        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2012 Billboard Music Awards, Manny Pacquiao vs. Timothy Bradley, Floyd Mayweather Jr. vs. Victor Ortiz\n- Places: MGM Grand Garden Arena, MGM Grand Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Las Vegas, Paradise, Nevada\n\nFacts:\n- The MGM Grand Garden Arena, originally known as the MGM Grand Garden Special Events Center, is a multi-purpose arena located within the MGM Grand Las Vegas on the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Floyd Mayweather Jr. vs. Victor Ortiz was held on September 17, 2011, at the MGM Grand in Las Vegas, Nevada, and was televised via HBO PPV.\n- The 2012 Billboard Music Awards was a music award ceremony held on May 20, 2012, at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Las Vegas, Nevada.\n- Manny Pacquiao vs. Timothy Bradley, billed as \"Perfect Storm,\" was a welterweight title boxing match held on June 9, 2012, at the MGM Grand Garden Arena in Paradise, Nevada.",
